# @hub-lanes

# ── BOARD API CONFORMANCE (BH-3947) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily: every in-app product board in fleet.conf is probed against the board
# API contract, GET only, and state/board-conformance/<p>.json is rewritten.
# A contract drift is slow, so once a day is enough. The probes are filled in by
# the BH-3947 siblings, which also add one deduped warn alert on a change. Off:
# flags/lane-off-board-conformance or bin/harness-ctl.sh off board-conformance.
35 7 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/board-conformance.sh --all >/dev/null 2>&1
